<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">- Nguu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">LUTI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu kiwandikwe ni Luti</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luti</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lut</para>
  <para style="mt2">KITABU KIWANDIKWE NI LUTI</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUTI</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOELO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s">Elimeleki na wanduguze waita Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />Aho kale Walamuzi wandaga wakalongoza mwe isi ya Izilaeli, halailaga gumbo mwe isi. Mnt'hu yumwenga kulawa Betelehemu ya Yuda yehe hamwenga na mkaziwe na wana wawe waidi wagendaga kwikala mwe isi ya Moabu enga watakwiza. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />Mnt'hu uyo etangagwa Elimeleki mkaziwe naye etangwagwa Naomi nuko kugamba kinyemi, wana wawe waidi we kigosi Maholoni na Kilioni. Mnt'hu uyo hamwenga na nduguye wandaga wa kabila dya Efulaimu uko Betelehemu ya Yuda. Wandaga mwe isi ya Moabu, wakekala uko. <verse eid="RUT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Mna Elimeleki mgosiwe Naomi abanikaga niyo Naomi asigala ekedu na wanawe waidi. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Wabwanga wadya niyo walomba wandele wa Kimoabu, wandele awo wandaga ni Olipa na Luti. Ize ijink'he miyaka mlongo, <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />wose waidi Maholoni na Kilioni nawo niyo wabanika. Ivo Naomi asigalaga heiina hata mwana hegu mnume.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naomi na Luti wauya Betelehemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />Naomi eze eve kugamba Zumbe kawavikila want'hu wa kwe isi yakwe kwa kuwenk'ha nk'hande, wakeikaga lumwe kulawa mwe isi ya Moabu kuuya kwawe, yehe hamwenga na wakaza wanawe. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Ivo wahalawaga hant'hu hadya wekalaga hamwenga na wakaza wanawe niyo wakonga kuuya mwe isi ya Yuda. <verse eid="RUT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />Naomi niyo awagamba wakaza wanawe waidi, “Uyeni kwenyu kwa wamami zenyu. Zumbe awenk'heni uwedi enga viya mwanitendelaga miye na walume zenyu wabanike. <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />Zumbe Mnungu awatendeni kila yumwenga ywenyu ande na kinyemi mwe kaya ya mnumewe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 1:9">Naomi niyo awakumbatila mna woho wakongaga kuila kwa usungu, <verse eid="RUT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />niyo wamgamba, “Bule! haikudaika, nekiite hamwenga na weye kwa want'hu wako.”<verse eid="RUT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Naomi niyo awagamba, “Bule, wanangu mwaungwa kuuya kwenyu. Nii mwanibasa miye? Haluse mwagamba neneleke wana we kigosi watuhu vileke wamilombeni? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />Uyeni kaya wanangu, kwaviya miye hidalahala hikudaha kulombigwa naho. Hata uneva nadaha kulombigwa kilo iki na kweleka wana we kigosi, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />haluse mwadaha kwikala haheina kulombigwa mpaka awa wakule? Bule! Mbuli ino kwangu ni ndala vidala kujink'ha nyuwe, kwaviya Zumbe niye anitendile ninde na makut'ho.”<verse eid="RUT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Woho niyo wakonga kuila naho. Niyo Olipa amkumbatila nine vyala na amlaga niyo kuuya kaya mna Luti niyo amtozeleza na kunda hamwenga na nine vyala. <verse eid="RUT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Naomi niyo amgamba, “Luti, kaula miyao kauya kwa want'hu wakwe na kwe milungu yakwe, kwa ivo waungigwa uuye hamwenga naye.”<verse eid="RUT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Mna Luti niyo amhitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">“Usekunihembeleza huleke weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">naho usekunifingiza kukutimila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">Kokose nowiite name neniite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">na uko nowikale nekikalanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">want'hu wako nawande want'hu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:16">Mnungu ywako naye naande Mnungu ywangu.<verse eid="RUT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />Aho nobanikile name nenibanikile aho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:17">na aho ukumoselwa msanga naho nenimoselwe msanga name,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:17">Zumbe Mnungu anisulumize nnakepanga na weye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="RUT 1:17">mna ifile du niyo neikipange miye na weye.”<verse eid="RUT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Naomi eze aone kugamba Luti atigiza waitanye naye hagendeele kuhigana naye naho. <verse eid="RUT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />Niyo wose waidi wakonga nt'hambo mpaka Betelehemu. Weze wabule uko want'hu wose niyo wehelwa, wavele niyo wauzana, “Uyu ni Naomi kindedi?”<verse eid="RUT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Naomi niyo agamba, “Msekunitanga naho Nahomi, nitangeni Mala, nuko kugamba usungu, kwaviya Mnungu mta ludole kautenda wikazi wangu unde na usungu vidala. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />Umwo nahalawaga aha nehinda na vint'hu vingi, mna ivi haluse Zumbe kanivuza hiina hata kint'hu. Haluse nii mwanitanga Naomi, ikanda Zumbe kanitowa na kunisulumiza?”<verse eid="RUT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Ivo nivo Naomi hamwenga na mka mwanawe Luti Mmoabu wauiye kulawa Moabu na kubula Beselehemu mwo lupisi ludya wakonga kuvuna shaili.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s">Luti adugana na Boazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />Kwandaga na mnt'hu akwitangwa Boazi uko Betelehemu uyo andaga mnt'hu mgoli na amanyikise. Naho uyo andaga ywe mp'huga ya Elimeleki mgosiwe dya Naomi. <verse eid="RUT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />Zuwa dimwenga, Luti Mmoabu niyo amgamba Naomi, “Nileke niite kwe nk'honde hasokoze. Kwa vovose nenimpate mnt'hu uyo naanigambe nisokoze.” Naomi niyo amgamba, “Ita mwanangu.”<verse eid="RUT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Ivo Luti niyo aita kwe nk'honde akasokoza akanda kunyuma ya wavuni. Niyo yalaila kugamba mwe nk'honde idya akasokoza ni dya Boazi wa lukolo lwa Elimeleki.<verse eid="RUT 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />Uukouko Boazi niyo abula kulawa Betelehemu, niyo awalamsa wavuni wakwe, niyo awagamba, “Zumbe ande hamwenga na nyuwe.” Nawo niyo wamhitula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:4">“Zumbe Mnungu akuvikile.”<verse eid="RUT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Boazi niyo amuuza yudya mkimalizi wa wavuni wakwe, “Yudya mndele ni yuhi?”<verse eid="RUT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Yudya mkimalizi wa wavuni niyo amhitula, “Ni yudya mndele Mmoabu yudya ezile hamwenga na Naomi kulawa mwe isi ya Moabu. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Kanilombeza, nimlekele aite akasokoze kwe nk'honde. Keza akadamanya ndima kukongela mtondo na ivi haluse kagenda kahumula kwe diheha.”<verse eid="RUT 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Boazi niyo amgambila Luti, “Tegeleza mwanangu. Usekugenda kusokoza hant'hu hatuhu mna mwe nk'honde ino du. Timilana na wavuni wangu we kivele. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Kaula hadya wakudamanyila ndima uite nawo. Hiwagambila wabwanga wasekukusezigila naho unatozwa ni nk'hilu ita kwa mabiga unywe mazi ayo watekile wabwanga awo. ”<verse eid="RUT 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Aho Luti niyo amfunamila Boazi mpaka hasi kwa wogohi, niyo amgamba, “Nii wanifanyanya hameso yako? Nii wanionela mbazi miye mgeni du?”<verse eid="RUT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Boazi niyo amhitula, “Hiva yose ayo umdamanyile nyokwe vyala kukongela mgosiwo eze abanike. Himanya ivo uwalekile welesi wako, niyo waileka isi yako na kwikala na want'hu awo wandile huwamanyize. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />Zumbe akugeleke kwa yose ayo udamanye akwikh'e nt'hunyo ikint'hile. Zumbe Mnungu ywa Izilaeli uyo umgulukile akudime mwe mikono yakwe.”<verse eid="RUT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Luti niyo amhitula, “Mkulu, weye kunidamanyila wedi utendese. Mna miye hiyo enga wadya wandima wako, kwaviya kunitondowaza naho kulonga na miye kwa lukunde.”<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />Viya wandile mo kudya, Boazi niyo amwitanga Luti nakumgamba, “So aha, soo udye mkate uuchank'hize mwe msuzi.” Luti niyo ekala hamwenga na wavuni wa shaili. Boazi amwink'haga mkazingo niyo adya eguta na kusigaza. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />Luti eze enuke na kuunga kugenda kusokoza shaili, Boazi niyo awagambila wavuni wakwe, “Mlekeni asokoze hata mwe makisa naho msekumlemeza. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Naho msomoeleni vichanga mwe makisa mlekeni asokoze msekumsunk'hasunk'ha.”<verse eid="RUT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Luti niyo agendeela kusokoza ngano mwe nk'honde kubula kisingi, eze ahute makisa niyo apata debe dimwenga dye shaili. <verse eid="RUT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Niyo aguha ulozo uwo mpaka ko mzi na kumlagisa nine vyala icho apatile. Niyo alava udya mkazingo usigale na kumwink'ha. <verse eid="RUT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Nine vyala niyo amuuza, “Kusokoza shaili yose ino? Nk'honde iyo noukasokoza ya ani? Mnungu amvikile uyo akutendile ivo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:19">Luti niyo amgambila Naomi kugamba nakanda akasokoza mwe nk'honde ya mnt'hu akwitangwa Boazi.<verse eid="RUT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />Ivo, Naomi niyo amgamba mke mwanawe, Zumbe naamvikile Boazi! “Zumbe akint'hiza lagano dyakwe kwa want'hu wandile wagima na wabanike.” Niyo agendeela kugamba, “Mnt'hu uyu ni ndugu ywetu ywa hagihi naho ni yumwenga mwa wadya wakuungwa kukilela.”<verse eid="RUT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Naho Luti niyo agamba, “Higambigwa ninde hamwenga na wavuni wakwe mpaka wabinde ulozo wose.”<verse eid="RUT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Naomi niyo amgamba Luti, “Mwanangu neinda ni vedi kwa weye ukadamanya ndima hamwenga na wavuni we kivele mwe nk'honde ya Boazi, kwaviya nougelwe kunswakunswa uneva unaita kwe nk'honde ya mnt'hu mtuhu.” <verse eid="RUT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Ivo Luti niyo adamanya ndima hamwenga na wavuni we kivele wa Boazi, niyo asokoza ulozo wa ngano na shaili na kuubinda wose mwe nk'honde. Mwo lupisi wose nakekala na nine vyala.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s">Luti apata mgosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Zuwa dimwenga, Naomi amgambaga Luti. “Naungigwa nikuzunguile mgosi vileke akulele. <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />Haluse yudya Boazi, uyo udamanye ndima hamwenga na wavuni wakwe we kivele ni wa lukolo lwetu, haluse tegeleza, kisingi iki naande aheta shaili. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />kwaivo uhake mazi na mavuta uvale suke zako zedi niyo uite kudya ukuhetela ngano mna kaula usekukelagisa kwakwe mpaka aho naabindile kudya no kunywa. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />Iviya iviya uhamanye hant'hu aho akuunga agone, anagona du ita mp'halahole gubula mgolole niyo ugona aho. Yehe naakugambile dyo kudamanya.”<verse eid="RUT 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Luti niyo amhitula, “Nenidamanye yose ayo unigambile.”<verse eid="RUT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Kwa ivo Luti aitaga hadya ho kuhetela shayili, niyo adamanya enga viya asigilwe na nine vyala. <verse eid="RUT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Boazi eze abinde kudya na kunywa, niyo asangalala. Niyo aita hagihi na idya shayili niyo agona. Luti aitaga mp'halahole niyo agubula mgolole wakwe na kugona aho. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Ize ibule kilo gati, Boazi niyo asetuka, niyo ahituka, ehelwagwa eze aone mvele kagona mwe viga vakwe. <verse eid="RUT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />Niyo auza, “Weye ni we ani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:9">Luti niyo amhitula, “Mkulu, ni miye Luti, mndima ywako. Kwaviya weye ywi ndugu ywangu ywa hagihi, nilombe miye mtumwa ywako.”<verse eid="RUT 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Boazi niyo agamba, “Zumbe naakuvike, kwaviya yadya yose udamanye kulagisa wogohi utendese kujinka yadya udamanye aho nk'hongo, kwaviya hukuwazungula wabwanga wakiwa hegu wagoli uleke wakulombe. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />Haluse mwanangu usekogoha, nenikudamanyile dyodyose ukulombeza kwaviya kila mnt'hu mo mzi uno kamanya uwedi wako ivo wili. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />Ni kindedi kugamba miye ni ndugu ywako ywa hagihi naho yaungwa hulele mna eyuko mnt'hu andile hagihi kujink'ha hata miye. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Kwaivo ikala aha nekilo iki chose, luvi mtondo nekione uneva naaunge akulele hegu bule. Uneva anaunga kwikala na weye ni vedi. Analemela, kwa zina dya Zumbe Mnungu mta ugima, miye nenikukombole. Gona aha mpaka luvi mtondo.”<verse eid="RUT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Ivo Luti niyo agona hadya mpaka mtondo, mna ize ibule mtondo niyo akelauka vileke asekuoneka, kwaviya Boazi hakuunga mnt'hu yeyose amanye kugamba hant'hu hadya nahanda na mvele. <verse eid="RUT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />Boazi niyo amgamba, “Tandika digunya dyako hasi”. Luti niyo atenda ivo. Boazi niyo akupula shayili debe dimwenga na vihimo vishano niyo amtwika, Luti niyo auya ko mzi. <verse eid="RUT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />Eze abule ko mzi, nine vyala niyo amuza, “Togola mwanangu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:16">Luti niyo amgambila nine vyala yadya yose Boazi amtendele. <verse eid="RUT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />Luti niyo agendeela kulonga, “Kanigamba nisekuuya kaya kwa mame vyala hiina kint'hu chochose niyo anikupuila debe dimwenga na vihimo vishano va shayili.”<verse eid="RUT 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Naomi niyo agamba, “Haluse tondowala mwanangu, mpaka aho nouone idyo dikuunga dilaile. Boazi dyelo heekale mpaka aho eze aone kabinda yose.”<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s">Boazi amlomba Luti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Boazi niyo aita hant'hu hadya ho kudamanyila mdugano ho mnango ho mzi niyo ekala hasi. Yudya ndugu dya Elimeleki yudya alongigwe ni Boazi, ombokaga hagihi. Boazi niyo amwitanga, niyo agamba, “Soo wikale aha.” Yudya mnt'hu ezaga na kwikala hadya. <verse eid="RUT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Niyo Boazi awetanga wadala mlongo wo mzi, niyo awagamba wekale. Wadya wadala niyo wekala. <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Boazi niyo amgamba yudya nduguye mto kwaga, “Haluse Naomi kauya kulawa mwe isi ya Moabu, aunga aitage nk'honde idya yandile ya ndugu yetu Elimeleki. <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />Ivo waungigwa umanye mwe mbuli ino. Haluse inanda waiunga nk'honde ino, ugule hameso ya wadala na want'hu wangu, unanda waiunga longa hegu hukuiunga longa, kwaviya weye una lupwapwazi lwa nk'hongo miye name ni ywa kaidi. Akuunga aikombole ni weye.” Naye niyo agamba, “Nenikombole miye.”<verse eid="RUT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Boazi niyo agamba, “Ni vedi mna unagula ink'honde iyo kulawa kwa Naomi Mmoabu, waungigwa umlombe Luti uyo abanikilwe ni mgosiwe vileke nk'honde iyo isigale mwa wandugu wa uyo mtokwaga.”<verse eid="RUT 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Yudya ndugu niyo amhitula, “Inanda niivo miye hikudaha kuikombola nk'honde iyo, kwaviya kugamba neniubanange ukipe wa wanangu. Uneva niivo guha lupwapwazi lwangu lwa kukombola weye kwaviya miye hikudaha kuikombola.”<verse eid="RUT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />Mazuwa yadya kwandaga na kihendo mwe Izilaeli, uneva mnt'hu aungaga kukombola hegu kwink'hana kint'hu, mnt'hu uyo aungwagwa alagise kwa kuhambula makwapa yakwe na kumwink'ha miyawe. Kwa kudamanya ivo Waizilaeli walagisaga kugamba mbuli zikala vedi.<verse eid="RUT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Ivo, mnt'hu uyo niyo amgamba Boazi, “Ikombole weye ink'honde iyo,” Niyo ahambula kwapa dyakwe na kumwink'ha Boazi. <verse eid="RUT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Niho Boazi awagambaga wadala na want'hu wose wandile aho “Dyelo nyuwe nomnde waona wangu. Muwona kugamba higula nk'honde kulawa kwa Naomi na vose vandile va Elimeleki na Kilioni na Maholoni. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />Naho yudya Luti Mmoabu abanikilwe ni mgosiwe Maholoni, himgula vileke ande mkazangu. Hidamanya ivo vileke ugoli wo uyo mtokwaga no lukolo wakwe usigale kwa want'hu wakwe mwo mzi uno. Naho nyuwe mwi waona.”<verse eid="RUT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />Ivo wadya wadala wandile hadya na want'hu wose niyo wamhitula, “Heye, suwe ni waona. Mnungu amtende mkazio ande enga Laheli na Lea awo wamwelekele Yakobo wana wengi. Nawe ukule mwo ugoli mwo lukolo lwa Efulata umanyike uko Beselehemu. <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />Zumbe akwink'he wana wengi kwombokela uyo mvele, mp'huga yako inde enga mp'huga ya Pelesi uyo Tamali amwelekaga Yuda.”<verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Boazi na welekwa wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Kwa ivo Boazi niyo amlomba Luti na kunda mkaziwe. Zumbe amvikilaga Luti niyo enula ubovu, niyo engila nyumba mwana kigosi. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Niyo wavele wo mzi uwo wamgambaga Naomi, “Mtogole Zumbe uyo heekudaha kukuleka dyelo haheina ndugu ywa kukulela, naho yehe ande mta nt'hogola nk'hulu mwe Izilaeli. <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />Mwana uyo naautende naho wikazi wako kunda uhya na kukulela mwo udala wako, kwaviya nyokwe vyala akukuunga kadamanya vedi kujink'ha wana kigosi mfungate kwaviya kamwink'ha cheleko.” <verse eid="RUT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Ivo Naomi amguhaga mwana uyo na kunda mlezi ywake mazuwa yose.<verse eid="RUT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Wadya wavele wandile hagihi wamwitangaga mwana uyo zina dyakwe niye Obedi niyo wagamba, “Mwana kelekwa kwa Naomi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 4:17">Naho Obedi amwelekaga Yese uyo amweleke Daudi.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Ivi nivo vyeleko va Pelesi, Pelesi amwelekaga Heziloni, <verse eid="RUT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />Heziloni amwelekaga Lami, Lami amweleka Aminadabu, <verse eid="RUT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />Aminadabu amwelekaga Nashoni na Nashoni amwelekaga Salimoni, <verse eid="RUT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />Salimoni amwelekaga Boazi, Boazi amweleka Obedi, <verse eid="RUT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />Obedi amweleka Yese, Yese naye niyo amweleka Daudi.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>